WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Excuse me while I use my dog for white balancing.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.260
Good morning, Hank, it's Thursday.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.840
Special surprise bonus video! 
So Hank, for the first time since 2012

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.540
we are going on tour to celebrate the release of 
Turtles All the Way Down and also

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.060
because we need an excuse to spend a few weeks together.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:15.860
There will be music and laughter and joy and I'll probably cry because I cry a lot.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.000
Q's will be A-ed, surprises will be plentiful and news from Mars and AFC Wimbledon will be shared.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.400
So today, I thought I'd answer real questions from real nerdfighters about the tour beginning with:

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.860
Q: Where are you going?

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.300
A: Okay, there are 19 stops, and I'm gonna do this all in one take.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.140
(1) New York; (2) Washington, D.C.; 
(3) Charlotte, North Carolina;

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.540
(4) Asheville, North Carolina; (5) Atlanta, Georgia;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.480
(6) Orlando, Florida -  where we will be playing 
Hank's High School Auditorium;

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.380
(7) Nashville, Tennessee; (8) Cincinnati, Ohio;

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.960
my hometown of (9) Indianapolis, Indiana;

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
(10) St. Louis, Missouri; (11) Chicago, Illinois; 
(12) Minneapolis;

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.080
and then on to Hanks hometown of
(13) Missoula, Montana;

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:54.200
from there to (14) Spokane, Washington 
and then (15) Bellingham, Washington;

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.720
and then (16) Portland, Oregon;

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.920
and then two shows in the (17 &amp; 18) San Francisco Bay Area

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.160
and then down to (19!) Los Angeles and I did it!

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.660
Who says that I'm over reliant on jump cuts?

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.180
One other thing: sadly there will be no Hank

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.320
at the shows in Asheville and Atlanta,

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:13.000
but there will be special surprise guest Hanks playing the role of Hank and you will hardly know the difference.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.440
So, a few of you might remember that in 2012, we did not visit the Midwest and there

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.540
was much consternation and I said at the time:

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:22.940
(Younger John) so Midwest this is me hugging you saying, I'm sorry. We'll be there next time.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:27.840
You will note that just six short years later, I am keeping that promise and this time I must say

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.640
to the people of Texas and the American Southwest and also the people living in the vast nation of not America:

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:36.000
I'm sorry, and we will try to visit you soon.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.320
Q: Why no love for [insert location here]?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.620
A: I love [insert location here].
I've always loved [insert location here].

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.780
[Insert personal anecdote] about [insert location here]

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:48.280
to prove love for [insert location here] 
and then [express regret].

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.240
Q: Are these shows gonna be spoiler free?

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.320
A :Yes, when it comes to my books but there might be some Star Wars spoilers.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.640
Q: Is it weird if I come alone?

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.420
A: No, lots of people will be coming alone.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.540
In fact there will be a special letter in the program just for people coming alone.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:04.660
But also you might find that you can make friends over at the tuatara discord or maybe even at the show.

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:05.740
Q: How much for the tickets?

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:09.599
A: So ticket prices have been set by the bookstores hosting the event so that they don't lose money,

00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:11.669
so it depends on the city and the venue,

00:02:11.669 --> 00:02:15.060
but every ticket comes with a signed copy of Turtles All the Way Down and also some other goodies.

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.700
Q: WIll there be a book signing?

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:17.660
A: Right, so this is the bad news.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:21.380
Partly because of the size of the venues, but mostly because of my brain's malfunctioning.

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.680
There will not be a signing after the show.

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:27.560
I'm really sorry about this and it's something that I've struggled with a lot, but I-

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:31.100
Yeah, it's just something I have to do, so, I'm sorry.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.100
Q: Will you guys be singing together?

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.260
A: Yeah, I'm also sorry about this the answer is probably yes, but only briefly.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.000
Q: Are you bringing turtles?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.320
A: Only metaphorical ones, but we're bringing a lot of those- like an infinite set of them.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.900
There is a link in the doobly-doo below where you can get more info about each event and also tickets.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.580
I will try to be in comments answering your questions.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.620
I hope to see lots of you on tour, it's gonna be an awesome time.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:54.680
and Hank, I cannot wait to traverse the country with you.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.520
I will see you on Friday.

